00:11:18.947 --> 00:11:24.413
A listener holding Toronto Dominion or Royal Bank after the latest housing update would

00:11:24.413 --> 00:11:29.293
have seen the stock open lower, expecting a quick reverse on resilient GDP numbers.

00:11:30.013 --> 00:11:35.273
In practice, the bid asks spread on the bank ETF widened from roughly 3 cents to 12 cents

00:11:35.273 --> 00:11:40.873
in the first hour, as market makers adjusted for uncertain mortgage loss provisions, which

00:11:40.873 --> 00:11:45.253
is how a macro headline becomes an execution cost before you even finish the order.

00:11:45.253 --> 00:11:50.933
BMO Chief Economist Douglas Porter wrote that this is arguably the most significant home

00:11:50.933 --> 00:11:56.233
price correction ever for Canada, and yet the economy has managed to avoid serious collateral

00:11:56.233 --> 00:11:57.753
damage from the deep decline.

00:11:58.513 --> 00:12:01.493
Porter cautions that part of that resilience is an illusion.

00:12:02.233 --> 00:12:07.733
Rapid population growth flattered the headline numbers, while real GDP per capita fell more

00:12:07.733 --> 00:12:12.153
than 2% peak to trough during the 2022-2023 stretch.

00:12:12.153 --> 00:12:18.846
Canada's real GDP grew at an annualized pace of about 1.7% over the four years since

00:12:18.846 --> 00:12:25.346
prices began falling, only slightly below this century's 2.0% average, which is exactly

00:12:25.346 --> 00:12:28.346
the headline that makes the per capita drop easy to miss.

00:12:28.966 --> 00:12:34.406
Variable rate mortgages reset sharply higher as the bank of Canada tightened, squeezing heavily

00:12:34.406 --> 00:12:39.346
indebted households faster than in the United States, and that reset schedule is the credit

00:12:39.346 --> 00:12:41.546
at risk clock, not the GDP print.

00:12:42.391 --> 00:12:46.911
The pro-check is to compare the quarter-over-quarter change in each bank's allowance for credit

00:12:46.911 --> 00:12:50.771
losses against the national home price index before adding to the position.

00:12:51.531 --> 00:12:56.251
Mortgage books at Toronto Dominion and Royal Bank of Canada are the market's main concern.

00:12:56.831 --> 00:13:01.831
Traders will watch provisions for credit losses each quarter for signs of stress, and Bank

00:13:01.831 --> 00:13:06.331
of Montreal sits on both sides of the story as the source of the warning and as a lender

00:13:06.331 --> 00:13:07.831
exposed to the same market.

00:13:07.831 --> 00:13:13.731
it. The common misconception is that a contained GDP impact automatically protects bank earnings.

00:13:14.411 --> 00:13:20.051
The fix is to track the per capita GDP decline, and the variable rate reset schedule instead

00:13:20.051 --> 00:13:26.148
of headline growth alone. Before we wrap, SunCore's third quarter free cash flow and buyback

00:13:26.148 --> 00:13:31.368
pace is the print I want against that refining margin story in the next session. That's

